From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SheepyLord <37598021+SheepyLord@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 01:25:10 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] i18n: complete weather display translations and reject
 incomplete catalogs

Translate preset labels and formatted weather status values without changing stored preset keys. Clarify radiance-cache labels and add completeness regressions. Make dependency setup tolerate the exclamation mark in the loader repository path.
---
 i18n/README.md                      |  13 +-
 i18n/fr.po                          | 226 +++++++++++++--------------
 i18n/glossary/fr.md                 |   6 +
 i18n/glossary/ja.md                 |   6 +
 i18n/glossary/ko.md                 |   6 +
 i18n/glossary/ru.md                 |   6 +
 i18n/glossary/zh-CN.md              |   6 +
 i18n/glossary/zh-TW.md              |   6 +
 i18n/ja.po                          | 230 ++++++++++++++--------------
 i18n/ko.po                          | 204 ++++++++++++------------
 i18n/remix.pot                      | 198 ++++++++++++------------
 i18n/ru.po                          | 228 +++++++++++++--------------
 i18n/tools/embed.py                 |  17 +-
 i18n/tools/test_embed.py            |  66 ++++++++
 i18n/zh-CN.po                       | 208 +++++++++++++------------
 i18n/zh-TW.po                       | 222 ++++++++++++++-------------
 scripts-common/update-deps.cmd      |  18 +--
 src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp |   7 +-
 18 files changed, 912 insertions(+), 761 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 i18n/tools/test_embed.py

diff --git a/i18n/README.md b/i18n/README.md
index 7a8bd661..edba7f3c 100644
--- a/i18n/README.md
+++ b/i18n/README.md
@@ -37,8 +37,8 @@ msgstr "启用或禁用光线追踪。"
 - `#.` names the option whose tooltip this is; `#:` is where the text is in the sources.
 - Change `msgstr` only. Long text may continue on following lines, each a `"..."` string; `\n` is a
   line break, `\"` a quote, `\\` a backslash.
-- An empty `msgstr` shows the English. `#, fuzzy` above an entry also keeps the English, until you
-  remove the flag.
+- Release builds reject missing, blank, fuzzy, duplicate, and unknown entries.
+  For a draft only, `embed.py --allow-incomplete` permits English fallback for missing, blank or fuzzy entries.
 - `#, c-format` marks a printf format: keep every `%d`, `%s`, `%.2f`, ... in the same order, and
   write a percent sign as `%%`.
 
@@ -47,11 +47,13 @@ Rebuild the runtime as usual (`meson compile -C _CompRelease_x64`). The build ru
 breaks a rule, the build stops and names the file and line, for example
 `error: i18n/ja.po:1234: printf conversions ['%d'] must match the English ['%d', '%s']`.
 
+Run the catalog regressions with `python -m unittest discover -s i18n/tools -p test_embed.py`.
+
 To check the files without building:
 
 ```powershell
 python i18n\tools\embed.py --pot i18n\remix.pot --latin-font external\fonts\NVIDIASans\NVIDIASansMd.ttf `
-  --fonts-dir i18n\fonts --out $env:TEMP\rtx_i18n_check.cpp i18n\zh-CN.po i18n\zh-TW.po i18n\ja.po i18n\ko.po i18n\fr.po i18n\ru.po
+  --fonts-dir i18n\fonts --out out\rtx_i18n_check.cpp i18n\zh-CN.po i18n\zh-TW.po i18n\ja.po i18n\ko.po i18n\fr.po i18n\ru.po
 ```
 
 ## A character the font does not have
@@ -84,7 +86,7 @@ python i18n\tools\update_strings.py
 ```
 
 It rewrites `remix.pot` from the sources and merges it into every `.po`: existing translations stay,
-new text gets an empty `msgstr` (shown in English until translated), and text that left the sources
+new text gets an empty `msgstr` (which must be translated before a release build), and text that left the sources
 moves to the end of the file as `#~` entries, so a translation is never lost. `--check` only reports
 whether `remix.pot` is current.
 
@@ -106,3 +108,6 @@ ImGui (`src/dxvk/imgui`) asks a translator for every text it draws or measures;
 hashing the English, so window positions, open headers and `imgui.ini` do not depend on the
 language. printf formats are swapped before formatting, only for translations with the same
 conversions. A language change rebuilds the font atlas with that language's glyphs.
+
+Weather preset names are localized for display, including the current/target/previous status.
+Preset keys passed to the weather system and exported to configuration files remain unchanged.
