-#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:631
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:632
 msgid "Intuitive thickness dial. 0 = clear, 1 = whiteout (~10 m visibility). Drives Transmittance Distance below (shorter distance = denser fog)."
 msgstr "直覺的濃度調整值。0 = 晴朗，1 = 一片白茫茫（能見度 ~10 m）。會驅動下方的「Transmittance Distance」（距離越短 = 霧越濃）。"
 
-#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:636
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:637
 msgid "Fog Tint"
 msgstr "霧色調"
 
-#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:638
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:639
 msgid "The colour the fog scatters (single-scattering albedo). This, not Transmittance Color, is what tints the fog you actually see."
 msgstr "霧所散射的色彩（單次散射反照率）。決定您實際看到之霧色調的是此值，而非「透射率色彩」。"
 
-#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:1029
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:1030
 msgid "(none / dormant)"
 msgstr "（無 / 休眠）"
 
-#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:1030 src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:1121
+#: src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:1031 src/dxvk/rtx_render/rtx_weather.cpp:1124
 msgid "clear"
